        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914200/extras/616ae7bf4ea1b823b628f624d7535f8c.avif?t=1768992753\" width=616 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the late 20th century, Malaysia has witnessed a series of mysterious disappearances. Victims seemed to vanish into thin air, leaving behind no trace. These unexplained incidents have occurred in a wide range of locations—from forests and elevators to hotels, schools, and even airplanes—with no clear pattern or cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2006, the protagonist, Liang, and the heroine, Huilin, were unexpectedly pulled into a strange and eerie dimension while riding an elevator. Separated in the chaos, they each begin a journey through this unknown realm—searching for one another, and trying to escape from this place shrouded in mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, the secrets behind this world slowly come to light, and the distance between Liang and Huilin gradually narrows. But the truth awaiting them at the end is far more profound than they could have imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices the player makes will shape the course of the story—leading to multiple endings, or unlocking an entirely new possibility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914200/extras/f74072824255e3004096948ef77877b7.avif?t=1768992753\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Investigation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a complex and unfamiliar world, players will control different characters to investigate their surroundings. As the exploration deepens, more companions will join the journey, unlocking new story clues. By finding key items and solving puzzles, players can open sealed paths, overcome obstacles, and gradually uncover the truth behind the events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time Action Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a fully ARPG-style real-time combat system. Enemies can appear at any moment during exploration, and players must make strategic use of weapons and skills to survive the dangers ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When facing powerful enemies, players can unleash special skills—such as slowing down time to escape danger, or briefly entering an invincible state to turn the tide of battle—adding layers of strategy and intensity to every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions you make will alter the fate of the characters and the direction of the story, ultimately leading to one of five different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Streaming &amp; Gameplay Footage Guidelines】</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and gameplay videos are allowed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would greatly appreciate it if you could include the game’s title in your stream/video title, or provide a link to the Steam page in the description.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are not responsible for any damages or issues arising from streaming or gameplay recordings.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914200/extras/616ae7bf4ea1b823b628f624d7535f8c.avif?t=1768992753\" width=616 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the late 20th century, Malaysia has witnessed a series of mysterious disappearances. Victims seemed to vanish into thin air, leaving behind no trace. These unexplained incidents have occurred in a wide range of locations—from forests and elevators to hotels, schools, and even airplanes—with no clear pattern or cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2006, the protagonist, Liang, and the heroine, Huilin, were unexpectedly pulled into a strange and eerie dimension while riding an elevator. Separated in the chaos, they each begin a journey through this unknown realm—searching for one another, and trying to escape from this place shrouded in mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, the secrets behind this world slowly come to light, and the distance between Liang and Huilin gradually narrows. But the truth awaiting them at the end is far more profound than they could have imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices the player makes will shape the course of the story—leading to multiple endings, or unlocking an entirely new possibility. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914200/extras/f74072824255e3004096948ef77877b7.avif?t=1768992753\" width=616 height=123 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Investigation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a complex and unfamiliar world, players will control different characters to investigate their surroundings. As the exploration deepens, more companions will join the journey, unlocking new story clues. By finding key items and solving puzzles, players can open sealed paths, overcome obstacles, and gradually uncover the truth behind the events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time Action Combat System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a fully ARPG-style real-time combat system. Enemies can appear at any moment during exploration, and players must make strategic use of weapons and skills to survive the dangers ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skill System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When facing powerful enemies, players can unleash special skills—such as slowing down time to escape danger, or briefly entering an invincible state to turn the tide of battle—adding layers of strategy and intensity to every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions you make will alter the fate of the characters and the direction of the story, ultimately leading to one of five different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Streaming &amp; Gameplay Footage Guidelines】</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and gameplay videos are allowed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would greatly appreciate it if you could include the game’s title in your stream/video title, or provide a link to the Steam page in the description.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are not responsible for any damages or issues arising from streaming or gameplay recordings.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Two souls are drawn into a mysterious otherworld—and torn apart. In a realm filled with danger and restless spirits, each searches for the other while uncovering hidden truths. A suspenseful multi-ending adventure where every choice shapes their fate.",
